@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5288
@pin = 1234

### Create game with fixed PIN (matches GAME_PIN in config.h) -> 201
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/games?pin={{pin}}

### Same PIN again -> 409
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/games?pin={{pin}}

### Invalid PIN -> 400
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/games?pin=12ab

### Random PIN -> 201
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/games

### Get game -> 200
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/games/{{pin}}

### Unknown game -> 404
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/games/0000

### Start with no players -> 409
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/games/{{pin}}/start

### Controller joins -> 200, number 1
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/controller/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pin": "{{pin}}", "name": "Mikkel", "deviceId": "OPLA_AABBCCDDEEFF" }

### Same device again -> 200, reconnected: true, same number
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/controller/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pin": "{{pin}}", "name": "Mikkel", "deviceId": "OPLA_AABBCCDDEEFF" }

### No name -> "Arduino 2"
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/controller/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pin": "{{pin}}", "deviceId": "OPLA_112233445566" }

### Unknown PIN -> 404 { ok:false }
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/controller/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pin": "0000", "deviceId": "OPLA_AABBCCDDEEFF" }

### Start -> 200, phase Playing
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/games/{{pin}}/start

### New controller mid-round -> 409 { ok:false, error:"Round in progress" }
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/controller/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pin": "{{pin}}", "deviceId": "OPLA_NEW000000000" }

### Rebooted controller mid-round -> 200, reconnected
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/controller/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pin": "{{pin}}", "deviceId": "OPLA_AABBCCDDEEFF" }

### End -> 200, phase Ended
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/games/{{pin}}/end

### Reset -> 200, phase Waiting, same players
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/games/{{pin}}/reset
